      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Homeopathic eye drops are not recommended for chemical burns like the one caused by drain cleaner. The best option is to try to remove the cleaner as quickly as possible. To minimize spreading the cleaner, try to flush your eye with just enough water to immediately dilute it, then remove the contact and flush the eye some more in the opposite direction. If this doesn't work, or if the pain is severe, try to go to an urgent care center or get to a hospital emergency room as quickly as possible.",
