    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the water isnt helping much and honestly my eye is still stinging like crazy... it's making me really anxious to go to the hospital and wait for hours. i'm looking at these eye drops again and they say they're \"natural soothing relief.\" wouldn't it be faster to just put those in to calm the inflammation down instead of sitting under a faucet for 20 minutes? plus i'm worried the water will just make my eye more irritated if it's already so sensitive. can't i just use the drops and see if it feels better in a bit?",
